  "slug": "catering-order-checklist-form",
  "title": "Catering Order Checklist Form",
  "subtitle": "The pre-departure check: production complete, restricted portions separated, temperatures recorded, vehicle loaded, and the site pack verified.",
  "description": "An original pre-departure readiness check for an off-premise catering delivery. It records the check identity and the order under check, production completion, separation and labeling of restricted portions, departure temperature readings, vehicle and pack verification, the release-to-depart decision, blocking findings, and the closeout that hands the load to the driver.",
  "use_case": "Use in the loading bay before a catering vehicle leaves, when a kitchen lead and manager verify that what is packed matches the order and can be held safely for the planned transit. The check closes when the load is released or the blocking findings are escalated.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
