        {
          "key": "check_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "What this check does and does not establish",
          "guidance": "This check records observations against the catering order at the moment of departure. It is not a food-safety certification and it does not cover what happens after handover at a site the venue does not control. Stop the departure and route to the responsible manager when a temperature is outside the venue standard, restricted portions are not separated, or the load does not match the order."
        }
      ]
